            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>One example discloses an oscillator circuit, including: a first stage, including: a first LC tank configured to output a first voltage; a first V-I converter, coupled to receive and convert the first voltage from the first LC tank into a first current; and a first current comparator, coupled to receive and convert the first current from the V-I converter into a second voltage; and a second stage coupled to receive and convert the second voltage from the first stage into a third voltage; wherein the first LC tank is configured to receive and convert the third voltage into the first voltage.</p>
            </abstract>
